// A library declares its own name. The project that depends on it
// repeats the name beside the path, and the two have to agree: a name
// belongs to the package, not to whoever is using it.
//
// `deps` is absent because this library has none. A project with no
// dependencies needs no `plum.pkg` at all; this one has a manifest only
// to say what it is called.
Package {
    name: "semver",
    version: "0.1.0",
}
